Superior cunning and training allows you to outthink and outwit your opponents' physical and mental assaults.  Increases Defense by [13, 17, 20, 23, 25 (TL1-5; DEX 100; CUN 100)] and Mental Save by [13, 17, 20, 23, 25 (TL1-5; DEX 100; CUN 100)].

The Defense bonus will scale with your Dexterity, and the save bonus with your Cunning.
